%% Ask a Development Agent, with RapidPro flows and the handover service (Telegram only, no SMS)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Farmer
  participant RP as RapidPro flow
  participant HO as Handover service
  participant DAB as DA backend roster
  actor DA as Development Agent
  F->>RP: Ask a DA: topic, photos / voice, Send
  RP->>HO: webhook: create question (contact uuid, kebele, topic, media ids)
  HO->>DAB: roster for kebele (mode, specialism, on leave)
  HO->>HO: pick DA (round robin) or kebele inbox, store question
  HO->>RP: send to DA's Telegram (header + media) via RapidPro API
  HO-->>RP: question number
  RP-->>F: "Your question Q-123 reached your DA"
  DA->>RP: reply (text / voice / photo) to the bot
  RP->>HO: webhook: DA message (match to open question)
  HO->>RP: relay to farmer with Q-123
  RP-->>F: DA's answer
  Note over HO,DA: alerts and reminders to Development Agents are Telegram messages only, no SMS
